ter, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes! Team up with your friends against AI or choose to fight in PvP!\n\n**Build your mage:** Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build. \n\n**Harness the elements:** Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks. \n\n**Grow in Power:** Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.\n\n**Choose Your Battle Mode:** Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.", "short_description": "Crystal Conquest is a free-to-play VR game where you control the elements and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/s/MYSTIC-INTERACTIVE-PRIVACY-POLICY.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Mystic Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/KV9f2dwTdY", "website_url": "https://www.crystalconquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ST